data: {"id": "c8e21930c4df4299-thinking-parallel_evidence-1814", "run_id": "c8e21930c4df4299", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将基于已采集的真实证据进行根因分析。当前所有关键数据已就绪，无需进一步工具调用。\n\n## 实体身份与生命周期\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v01/workload`, UID `6743bbac-5908-452b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`\n- **状态**: `Pending`，`nodeName: None`，未绑定任何节点\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **生命周期**: 未删除（`deletionTimestamp: <absent>`），从创建（`2026-09-11T05:28:07Z`）起持续处于 Pending 状态\n\n## 支持候选原因的证据（PendingUnschedulable → Insufficient CPU）\n\n**Pod YAML 条件确认**:\n```\nconditions:\n- PodScheduled: status=False reason=Unschedulable \n  message=0", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789105813342, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

